---
// Programs.astro
---
<section id="programlar" class="py-24 bg-bek-bg relative">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        
        <!-- Üst Başlık Alanı -->
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-bek-dark mb-6 tracking-tight">
                Verdiğimiz <span class="font-bold text-bek-gold">Hizmetler</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-light">
                Sınırlı kontenjan ile nitelikli eğitim prensibiyle, her yaş grubuna özel yapılandırılmış programlar sunuyoruz.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- ANA PROGRAMLAR (Ortaokul ve Lise) -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16">
            
            <!-- ORTAOKUL KARTI -->
            <div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-14 rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 relative overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-bek-dark opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-bek-dark mb-1 tracking-tight">ORTAOKUL</h3>
                <p class="text-bek-gold font-semibold tracking-widest mb-10 text-sm">(5 - 6 - 7 - 8)</p>
                
                <ul class="space-y-6">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-dark" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">LGS Hazırlık & Okul Derslerine Destek</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-dark" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">Fen Bilimleri & Matematik</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-dark" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">Türkçe, Sosyal Bilgiler & İngilizce</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- LİSE KARTI -->
            <div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-14 rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 relative overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-bek-gold opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-bek-dark mb-1 tracking-tight">LİSE</h3>
                <p class="text-bek-gold font-semibold tracking-widest mb-10 text-sm">(9 - 10 - 11 - 12 - MEZUN)</p>
                
                <ul class="space-y-6">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-bek-gold/10 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">TYT - AYT Hazırlık</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-bek-gold/10 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">Ders Takibi</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-bek-gold/10 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">Sınav Koçluğu</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-bek-gold/10 p-1 rounded-full mt-1">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-bek-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">Etüt Programları</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ÖZEL KULÜPLER VE ATÖLYELER (Yeni Eklenen Kısım) -->
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center text-bek-dark mb-10">Özel Kulüpler & Atölyeler</h3>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Yarışma Kartı -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-bek-gold/50 transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-bek-gold/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-bek-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-bek-dark mb-2">Ulusal & Uluslararası Yarışmalar</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">TÜBİTAK, TEKNOFEST, URFODU, Kanguru ve Olimpiyatlara özel hazırlık rehberliği.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- İlkokul Ödev Kartı -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-bek-gold/50 transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-bek-gold/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-bek-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-bek-dark mb-2">İlkokul Ödev Kulübü</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Düzenli takip, pekiştirme etkinlikleri ve sorumluluk bilincini geliştiren çalışma ortamı.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Deneme Kulübü Kartı -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-bek-gold/50 transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-bek-gold/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-bek-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-bek-dark mb-2">Deneme Kulübü</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Düzenli sınav uygulamaları, detaylı sonuç analizi ve hedef odaklı gelişim takibi.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Yaz Okulu Kartı -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-bek-gold/50 transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-bek-gold/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-bek-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 10l-2 1m0 0l-2-1m2 1v2.5M20 7l-2 1m2-1l-2-1m2 1v2.5M14 4l-2-1-2 1M4 7l2-1M4 7l2 1M4 7v2.5M12 21l-2-1m2 1l2-1m-2 1v-2.5M6 18l-2-1v-2.5M18 18l2-1v-2.5"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-bek-dark mb-2">Yaz Okulu Atölyeleri</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Kodlama, Hızlı Okuma, Sanat, Tenis ve Binicilik ile verimli ve eğlenceli tatil programı.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>